                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu akamwambia, Angalia, usimwambie mtu; ila enenda zako, ukajionyeshe kwa kuhani, ukaitoe sadaka kama alivyoamuru Musa, iwe ushuhuda kwao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.4",
